# Implementation Plan — Correct Barren Drill Hole Labels Within BMC Raster Bounds

Align the negative label dataset (`barren_negative_labels.gpkg`) with the positive label dataset by sampling confirmed barren drill hole collars directly from the **GeoNB Drill Hole Registry** (`nb_drill_holes.gpkg`) **strictly inside the Bathurst Mining Camp (BMC) study area raster grid** (`mag_rmi_bmc_combined1.tif`).

This corrects the previous discrepancy where 179 out of 250 negative points (71.6%) fell outside the raster footprint due to regional synthetic bounding box sampling.

