> 1. **100% Spatial Containment across Entire Dataset:**
>    * **Positive Labels (`vms_positive_labels.gpkg`):** 45 / 45 (100.00% inside BMC raster)
>    * **Negative Labels (`barren_negative_labels.gpkg`):** 250 / 250 (100.00% inside BMC raster)
> 2. **Real GeoNB Drill Collar Provenance:** Replaces synthetic wide-area drill coordinates with 125 real drill hole collars selected from the 10,377 GeoNB drill holes located inside the BMC raster grid.
> 3. **Geographic & Feature Guard Enforcement:** All sampled barren drill holes are guaranteed to be $\ge 1,000\text{ m}$ away from any known VMS deposit, while pseudo-absences continue to use top 40% Mahalanobis feature-space dissimilarity.

